<title>USA: Material Sciences CFO retires.</title>
<headline>Material Sciences CFO retires.</headline>
<dateline>ELK GROVE VILLAGE, Ill. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Material Sciences Corp said Friday its chief financial officer William Vrba will retire effective September 30.</p>
<p>The company said James Waclawik will succeed Vrba. Waclawik joined MSC Pre Finish Metals Inc, a unit of Material Sciences, in 1988 and most recently worked as controller of that subsidiary.</p>
<p>Vrba will serve as a consultant to the company for one year following his retirement, Material Sciences said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
